N,O-diacetylmuramidase activity
lysozyme g
globulin G1
peptidoglycan N-acetylmuramoylhydrolase activity
PR1-lysozyme
globulin G
L-7001""" ;
    default1:definition "Catalysis of the hydrolysis of the beta-(1->4) linkages between N-acetylmuramic acid and N-acetyl-D-glucosamine residues in a peptidoglycan." ;
    default1:reference "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0003796" ;
